  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity building for protection of young women&apos;s rights to education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEMPROW will work to &apos;encourage and enhance the meaningful enhancement of girls&apos; whilst they are at school and into adulthood. They recognise the need for a holistic approach which includes transforming the local community. MEMPROW will work with selected community leaders - teachers, parents, religious, cultural leaders which is important in realising longer term change. Organised dialogue between young men and women and opportunities for training together bring a further dimension to young women&apos;s empowerment and vital male participation through mindset change. Lifeskills training and mentoring of girls in school and support to staff to protect girls from violence in school are essential.</narrative>
  </description>
